# Windsurf VibeUI Design Rules

- Enforce modern dark-mode aesthetics (deep navy/slate `#07090e`, glowing borders, glassmorphic cards).
- Never render flat boring `#111` or `#222` gray containers without lighting or depth.
- Pair sans-serif font for copy with monospace font for stats, tags, and code.
- Provide tactile hover and active states on all clickable elements.
